@startuml
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Sơ Đồ Giao Tiếp Tương Tác (Communication Diagram) - GiaoVienHay\nCơ Chế Trao Đổi Thông Điệp Hướng Đối Tượng Giữa Các Thành Phần (100% Nền Tảng Firebase)

' ==============================================================================
' 1. CÁC TÁC NHÂN NGƯỜI DÙNG (ACTORS)
' ==============================================================================
object "<u>:Admin</u>" as Admin
object "<u>:Teacher</u>" as Teacher
object "<u>:Parent</u>" as Parent

' ==============================================================================
' 2. TẦNG GIAO DIỆN CLIENT (PRESENTATION OBJECTS)
' ==============================================================================
object "<u>:WebAdminUI</u>\n(Next.js App)" as WebAdminUI
object "<u>:WebTeacherUI</u>\n(Next.js App)" as WebTeacherUI
object "<u>:MobileTeacherUI</u>\n(React Native)" as MobileTeacherUI
object "<u>:MobileParentUI</u>\n(React Native)" as MobileParentUI

' ==============================================================================
' 3. TẦNG BACKEND & API GATEWAY (NESTJS PLATFORM)
' ==============================================================================
object "<u>:APIGateway</u>\n(Routing & Firebase Auth Guard)" as Gateway
object "<u>:AdminSchoolService</u>\n(NestJS Admin Module)" as AdminSvc
object "<u>:AcademicService</u>\n(NestJS Academic Module)" as AcademicSvc
object "<u>:FeesInsuranceService</u>\n(NestJS Fee/BHYT Module)" as FeeSvc
object "<u>:NotificationService</u>\n(NestJS Noti Module)" as NotiSvc

' ==============================================================================
' 4. TẦNG DỮ LIỆU & DỊCH VỤ GOOGLE FIREBASE
' ==============================================================================
object "<u>:CloudFirestore</u>\n(NoSQL Document Store)" as Firestore
object "<u>:FirebaseFCM</u>\n(Cloud Messaging Service)" as FCM
object "<u>:FirebaseStorage</u>\n(Lưu trữ tài liệu giáo án)" as FBStorage

' ==============================================================================
' CÁC LUỒNG GIAO TIẾP & THÔNG ĐIỆP ĐƯỢC ĐÁNH SỐ THEO PHÂN HỆ
' ==============================================================================

' --- NHÓM 1: Quản trị Trường học & Cấu hình Hệ thống (Admin -> Web Next.js) ---
Admin -- WebAdminUI : 1.1: login(credentials)\n1.2: manageSchoolStructure(classes, subjects)\n1.3: assignTeachers(homeroom, subjects)\n1.4: manageStudentParentLink(records)\n1.5: configureFeeAndInsuranceTerms(terms)

WebAdminUI -- Gateway : 1.6: HTTP POST /api/v1/auth/login\n1.7: HTTP REST /api/v1/admin/* (CRUD)\n1.8: HTTP POST /api/v1/fees/config

Gateway -- AdminSvc : 1.9: forwardAdminRequest(validatedToken)
Gateway -- FeeSvc : 1.10: forwardFeeConfigRequest(token)
AdminSvc -- Firestore : 1.11: saveSchoolData(/classes, /users, /students)
FeeSvc -- Firestore : 1.12: initFeeRecords(/fees_and_insurance)

' --- NHÓM 2: Nghiệp vụ Sư phạm & Lớp học (Giáo viên -> Web & Mobile App) ---
Teacher -- WebTeacherUI : 2.1: login(credentials)\n2.2: importDocsAndGenerateGame(file)\n2.3: runClassroomMiniGame(gameType)\n2.4: inputInClassGrades(classId, scores)\n2.5: viewClassLeaderboard()\n2.6: checkFeesInsuranceList(homeroomClassId)\n2.7: togglePaidFlag(studentId, isPaidTuition, isPaidInsurance)

Teacher -- MobileTeacherUI : 2.8: quickAttendance(classId, presentList, absentList)\n2.9: viewHomeroomFeeStatus()

WebTeacherUI -- Gateway : 2.10: HTTP POST /api/v1/quizzes/generate\n2.11: HTTP POST /api/v1/academic/in-class-scores\n2.12: HTTP GET /api/v1/academic/leaderboard\n2.13: HTTP PATCH /api/v1/fees-insurance/toggle
MobileTeacherUI -- Gateway : 2.14: HTTP POST /api/v1/attendance/submit

Gateway -- AcademicSvc : 2.15: forwardAcademicRequest(teacherToken)
Gateway -- FeeSvc : 2.16: forwardFeeUpdateRequest(teacherToken)
FeeSvc -- Firestore : 2.17: updateBooleanFlags(is_paid_tuition, is_paid_insurance)
AcademicSvc -- Firestore : 2.18: persistGradesAndAttendance(/scores, /attendances, /quiz_results)
AcademicSvc -- FBStorage : 2.19: uploadAndStoreDocFile(docx, pdf)
AcademicSvc -- NotiSvc : 2.20: notifyGradePublished(classId, subjectCode)
FeeSvc -- NotiSvc : 2.21: notifyFeeReminder(classId)

' --- NHÓM 3: Cổng Phụ huynh (Parent -> Mobile App React Native) ---
Parent -- MobileParentUI : 3.1: login(credentials)\n3.2: switchChildProfile(childId)\n3.3: viewChildAcademicReport(grades, GPA)\n3.4: viewAttendanceHistory()\n3.5: viewTuitionAndInsuranceStatus(isPaidFlags)

MobileParentUI -- Gateway : 3.6: HTTP POST /api/v1/auth/login\n3.7: HTTP GET /api/v1/students/:id/academic\n3.8: HTTP GET /api/v1/students/:id/attendance\n3.9: HTTP GET /api/v1/students/:id/fees-insurance

Gateway -- FeeSvc : 3.10: queryFeeStatus(studentId)
FeeSvc -- Firestore : 3.11: fetchBooleanFlagsAndAmounts(/fees_and_insurance)
Gateway -- AcademicSvc : 3.12: queryAcademicStatus(studentId)
AcademicSvc -- Firestore : 3.13: fetchScoresAndAttendance(/scores, /attendances)

' --- NHÓM 4: Bắn Thông Báo Đẩy Thời Gian Thực (FCM) ---
NotiSvc -- Firestore : 4.1: queryParentAccountAndFCMTokens(/users)
NotiSvc -- FCM : 4.2: sendMulticastPushNotification(fcmTokens, payload)
FCM -- MobileParentUI : 4.3: pushBackgroundNotification(alertTitle, alertBody)
MobileParentUI -- Parent : 4.4: renderPushBannerNotification()

@enduml
